SY_TALK("0ZjiaYNAY4o",[[683,["It’s such a great thing to meet your children","after such a long time."]],[689,["And","this country was really pestered with cold"]],[698,["so I had to come here I think, just to make","you feel warmer with love."]],[703,["It’s a very heartening thing to see so many","people who are in England, who are Sahaj Yogis."]],[718,["As you know England has to do tremendous effort","to keep Sahaja Yoga afloat; not only that,"]],[732,["but you have to set in examples for others."]],[738,["As England is the heart of the universe it","circulates."]],[746,["Whatever example you set in, circulates."]],[749,["People try to follow you."]],[752,["As I have told you before also, that English","people should not try to follow other people"]],[758,["but establish their own proper character."]],[762,["But not to be insular by which you don’t","appreciate anybody else or you cannot understand"]],[770,["international relationships."]],[773,["We are one world and it’s only one great","Viraat in Whose being we circulate."]],[788,["Moreover for the people who are from the heart,","[they] have to be much more open and moving"]],[798,["and giving because that’s the job of the","cell of blood that passes through [the] heart;"]],[805,["and that’s how you are made specially for","this."]],[827,["I have been speaking after you finished your","tour on a subject in India."]],[835,["But I think it is more related to us here","in the West than to Indians."]],[841,["And that is something we have to understand:","that we are in the midst of terrible conditions,"]],[850,["horrible conditions which are taking us to","hell."]],[859,["And we realise how important it is for us","to get together and save this area which we"]],[877,["called as ‘the Western world’."]],[880,["So I have already given a little talk which","you may hear when you have this seminar or"]],[888,["this Shiv puja."]],[891,["But I would like to tell you about it: that","Shri Krishna, a long time back, told that"]],[902,["the roots of the awareness are in the brain,","but the human awareness grows downward."]],[910,["That’s how we have grown downward."]],[916,["We have grown towards things which, if allowed","to grow that way, may take us away completely"]],[930,["from the roots."]],[932,["Now if you start the movement, as I said,","from Bhavasagara, from the evolutionary process,"]],[942,["of going downward."]],[945,["Now in the Bhavasagara that is in the viscera","of the stomach and all these places, we have"]],[955,["a capacity, what we call as of consumption."]],[960,["We can even consume the poison."]],[965,["The liver can consume the poison; it has the","capacity to consume the poison as heat and"]],[973,["then it delivers the heat to the water of","the bloodstream."]],[982,["So the capacity we have to consume all those","things makes us, what we call ‘swahaa’:"]],[991,["‘swahaa’ means ‘consumption’."]],[995,["And from this consumption, when we consume","all these things: we consume our ego, we consume"]],[1002,["our conditioning, we consume all those things","which are detrimental to our growth [then]"]],[1007,["we become ‘swadhaa’."]],[1009,["‘Swa‘ is the Spirit and ‘dha’ is the","dharma."]],[1014,["We get the dharma of the Spirit."]],[1019,["And you know what is the dharma of the Spirit","is – is Sahaj, Sahaja."]],[1026,["But when we start going downward only with","our awareness, from the Nabhi Chakra we start"]],[1033,["moving downward, what happens to us [is] that","we move to the second position of Swadhishthana"]],[1041,["and the Swadhishthana has got the essence,","I mean, has got the capacity to be ‘bhurvah’."]],[1047,["‘Bhurvah’ means the whole Creation, the","universe that is created."]],[1054,["That’s how we get creativity through Swadhishthana."]],[1058,["So when we start moving downward, what happens","to us [is] we go to all the stars and the"]],[1066,["planets and all that are created, that’s","what we are doing, wasting our energy for"]],[1070,["nothing at all."]],[1072,["But apart from that in the wrong way when","we move, our attention goes to creativity"]],[1077,["which is destructive, which is negative, which","brings death, which suggests insipidness."]],[1088,["Like the art today is, when you see the art,","you don’t know whether to vomit, to run"]],[1093,["away or to cry."]],[1096,["So that explains why people are producing","such horrid things and when you look at them"]],[1101,["you don’t understand what is this going","on."]],[1105,["So the art, the creativity, in every way,","the creativity of every kind becomes so horrid."]],[1116,["So the third stage is that we go to ‘bhuh‘."]],[1120,["‘Bhuh’ is this Mother Earth."]],[1124,["Mother Earth is the one which also creates","Shri Ganesh."]],[1128,["Now when we go towards Mother Earth we start","extracting Mother Earth, taking out all that"]],[1133,["is precious, that is needed out of proportion","– because we have got machines."]],[1138,["Now we have got machines so we must produce."]],[1140,["The machine must produce more and more and","more, out of proportion it should go on."]],[1147,["And when it wants to continue it has to go","on that way so that you feed the machine to"]],[1153,["produce more."]],[1158,["Now this production is useless!"]],[1164,["There is no need to have so much production","for us."]],[1166,["You see plastics after plastics, then there’s","nylons after nylons, then there’s all kinds"]],[1173,["of polyester and I don’t know all kinds","of things that they have started producing."]],[1177,["All man-made nonsense that they have."]],[1180,["There’s no need to have so much."]],[1183,["Then we go on accumulating things and that’s","how we become extremely materialistic people."]],[1188,["Actually to be materialistic in the real sense","is that we understand the value of matter."]],[1193,["And the value of the matter is aesthetics."]],[1196,["Artistic things, real artistic things."]],[1199,["And beyond that the value of matter is that","you can give love to others through that matter:"]],[1206,["by giving as presents, by your generosity."]],[1210,["So you lose that also!"]],[1211,["That power also you lose."]],[1213,["That is, you start extracting your Mother","Earth in such a way that you don’t know"]],[1221,["what to do with the acid gas that is coming","out of these productions and then all your"]],[1226,["trees are getting destroyed."]],[1228,["It’s so destructive."]],[1229,["The whole thing is so destructive."]],[1232,["So then you move to the essence of Mooladhara","which is innocence."]],[1241,["And when it is innocence, you start attacking","innocence."]],[1245,["Now you read horrible things, when you come","here."]],[1247,["I got the jitters when I heard about the six","year old girl and a three year old girl: I"]],[1253,["just can’t bear it."]],[1254,["Supposing that was my child what would have","happened to me?"]],[1258,["And it’s my child."]],[1259,["That’s how I feel."]],[1260,["Then we are attacking the innocence everywhere","in every place and we have no sense of Mooladhar."]],[1266,["That’s how we go down."]],[1269,["And one step forward where do we go?"]],[1273,["Into hell."]],[1276,["That is our movement."]],[1277,["We are going towards hell!"]],[1279,["Straight forward, our movement is towards","hell!"]],[1283,["Because I have explained in that little talk,","you can hear it again, that, when you see"]],[1288,["the steps, you see the downward steps, then","you just see the platforms which are very"]],[1294,["good, maybe of marble, very attractive, very","sensational, whatever you may call it."]],[1299,["And you feel like going down, it’s easy","to go down with the gravity because you have"]],[1303,["come out from amoeba state or even earlier","from carbon stage, so you feel it’s easy"]],[1312,["to go down."]],[1313,["It’s much easier to go down, so you go on","stepping on these steps and go down."]],[1319,["You don’t see the heights."]],[1321,["But when you are going higher, rising higher","then you start seeing the heights."]],[1327,["And when you see the heights what do you see","from down below?"]],[1331,["Absolutely this is our task."]],[1333,["From the hell we have to pull out people up."]],[1336,["That’s hell!"]],[1337,["And this is what we call as the ‘adhogati’","– going downward."]],[1341,["‘Adhogati’ – going downward."]],[1343,["We have to take to ‘Urdhvagati’ ( ऊर्ध्वगति)-","going higher."]],[1347,["How do we go higher?"]],[1349,["Only Kundalini is the way."]],[1351,["That you can see clearly."]],[1353,["Even people who try to go higher without the","Kundalini, say from Nabhi upwards, how do"]],[1358,["they do it?"]],[1359,["They go up to mana, this is the emotional","side, that’s the motherhood."]],[1366,["And you go against the mother."]],[1368,["When you go there what you find [is] that","you get attached to this woman, that woman,"]],[1373,["then that thing."]],[1374,["It goes on to this family, to other things","and again you come down."]],[1380,["Then you go ahead, you go into ‘janah’","– is the one which is what we call ‘the"]],[1386,["public’, ‘the others’."]],[1387,["‘Janah’ is ‘the public’, is the Viraata’s","place."]],[1390,["As you know this is the Viraata’s place."]],[1392,["And when you go to that place, to Viraata’s","place, what happens to you [is] that you start"]],[1399,["becoming very conscious of yourself, “Oh,","I am a public man."]],[1402,["I am a public person."]],[1403,["This is my reputation."]],[1404,["I am this and I am that.\""]],[1406,["And then you start exploiting people with","your politics and all other things like that."]],[1410,["And you develop your egos; all kinds of nonsensical","things."]],[1419,["With your mana, from your centre heart, you","develop also your conditionings and that’s"]],[1426,["how you develop a funny personality which","is not urdhvagati, which is not going higher,"]],[1432,["but is actually giving you additional problems","on your back!"]],[1439,["Then the third thing is here at the Agnya,","as I told you, you develop your ego."]],[1446,["The other day Patrick rang me up to say, “Mother,","why are we developing our Agnyas so much nowadays?”"]],[1451,["I said, “Stop reading newspapers!”"]],[1454,["The prime ministers are fighting for their","seats and this and that and if you read newspapers"]],[1459,["you will also feel that you are a prime minister","[and] you better fight it."]],[1463,["Because when you see a picture or any drama","sometimes you get identified and you think,"]],[1469,["“I am Napoleon myself!”"]],[1473,["So don’t read newspapers!"]],[1477,["Don’t read about these mad people who are","just trying to overpower each other."]],[1483,["Like this [Ferdinand] Marcos fellow."]],[1485,["The other day somebody said that, “Mother,","you get rid of this Marcos!”"]],[1488,["Now he’s out!"]],[1489,["So many will be out but what about us?"]],[1491,["Do we have some of them within our heads?"]],[1494,["Do we also have the same ideas of materialism","or ego or all these trips that these people"]],[1501,["have had?"]],[1503,["So as a result, when you see these things,","on the contrary, you should try to avoid it"]],[1509,["and jump on to urdhvagati."]],[1513,["Then you go higher, from there, in the head","is the Sat, is the Truth."]],[1518,["That’s what you discover, Truth; should","discover in the normal way."]],[1522,["But in the abnormal conditions when you try","just to climb up to the brain, what happens"]],[1529,["is that whatever you know through your mental","conception becomes the truth."]],[1536,["Everyone is like that."]],[1537,["You see, about religion you will find a person","believes that, “This is the truth."]],[1540,["Now this is the truth!”"]],[1542,["“I am the one who represents Christianity”,","“I am the one who represents Mohammad Sahib”,"]],[1549,["“I am the one who represents Nanak Sahib”,","“I am the one who represents Shri Rama,"]],[1555,["Shri Krishna.\""]],[1557,["None of them represent."]],[1558,["It’s just a concept."]],[1560,["And with that concept if you move about like","that then what happens [is] you just get stuck"]],[1564,["on to that idea."]],[1566,["That is how fanaticism comes in as far as","religion is concerned."]],[1569,["There are many, many things like that, “This","is a concept and that’s the fact, and that’s"]],[1575,["the truth and that’s what I believe in this!”"]],[1579,["But why do you believe in that?"]],[1581,["Who are you?"]],[1583,["When they say, “I believe,” just go and","ask them, “Who are you after all to believe"]],[1586,["in that?”"]],[1587,["That’s Mr."]],[1588,["Ego, that’s all."]],[1590,["Then there are people who are conditioned."]],[1593,["And that’s what, whatever is their conditioning,","they think, “This is the conditioning."]],[1597,["This is the thing I am brought up."]],[1598,["This is how I have lived and this is how I","am, and this is what is the truth.\""]],[1603,["Both things are absurd, mythical."]],[1608,["That’s not the Truth."]],[1612,["So when you start through your urdhvagati,","through your Kundalini you see the height."]],[1618,["You see that, “Now we have to rise!"]],[1620,["We have to rise."]],[1621,["Rise with our innocence."]],[1622,["We have to get to our innocence.\""]],[1624,["We have to be innocent people."]],[1627,["But even in Sahaja Yoga you will find some","people, I call them sometimes like monkeys,"]],[1632,["jump from urdhvagati to adhogati, adhogati","to urdhvagati."]],[1634,["You don’t know which side they are going!"]],[1641,["You have to hold on to these steps which you","have got."]],[1643,["First is the innocence."]],[1645,["Your morality, as you call that, or a chastity."]],[1651,["That’s the first step you have to achieve."]],[1654,["Unless and until you achieve that step how","are you going to go further?"]],[1661,["But it’s the other way round."]],[1662,["They think if you tell something very truthfully","to Mother, “I have had five love affairs,"]],[1667,["I have had six abortions, ten this thing,","then Mother is going to be very happy with"]],[1673,["me,” because they have told the truth."]],[1676,["That’s not the truth."]],[1678,["That’s not what is wanted."]],[1681,["Are you now a chaste person?"]],[1683,["Have you got the ideas of chastity and dharma?"]],[1689,["That is the second step you can move into."]],[1693,["Aesthetically, are you rich aesthetically,","are you generous?"]],[1699,["Can you appreciate the art of every country?"]],[1702,["Or you just say, “Oh it’s not good because","it’s not English!”?"]],[1706,["Or “It’s not good because it’s not French!”?"]],[1708,["Or maybe, “It’s not from Wimbledon!”"]],[1710,["Could come to that point!"]],[1714,["I mean, what is happening to us?"]],[1716,["We are becoming so insular, so small, so narrow","in our outlook, that’s impossible."]],[1725,["We cannot appreciate another person at all."]],[1728,["You ask anyone, everybody has an opinion about","others, what about yourself?"]],[1733,["What is your opinion about yourself?"]],[1735,["Can you laugh at yourself?"]],[1738,["And when I am giving lecture we also sometimes","think that Mother is talking about somebody"]],[1743,["xyz, not about me."]],[1744,["That’s not so."]],[1746,["We have to project to ourselves and find out:","are we in chastity?"]],[1751,["Are we in dharma?"]],[1752,["Have we achieved that?"]],[1753,["Have we achieved our innocence?"]],[1756,["Have our eyes achieved that innocence, that","simplicity, that power?"]],[1765,["So then we move up higher on the bhurvah state","where we have to know: are we aesthetically"]],[1774,["equipped?"]],[1775,["Do we have proper aesthetics?"]],[1781,["In our behaviour, in our dress, in our lifestyle,","in everything?"]],[1788,["Or are we still going on with the same things?"]],[1792,["Like some hippies when they come to Sahaja","Yoga, it’s impossible to make them understand"]],[1796,["that – no more hippies now!"]],[1802,["Then some come from another group, another","funny style, then they have the same style"]],[1807,["of behaviour."]],[1808,["No!"]],[1809,["‘Sahaja’: we have to be in the Sahaja","style, which is a common style for all the"]],[1814,["Sahaja Yogis all over the world to dress up","decently, to talk decently, to have sweet"]],[1819,["words, no harsh words, no anger, no temper,","nothing of the kind."]],[1825,["But very, very gentle and a dignified personality."]],[1832,["Now here some of the so-called dignified also","can be very bhootish, I have seen that."]],[1838,["They can be very dignified and they can be","very inauspicious."]],[1843,["So another quality of innocence, which is","auspiciousness; or we can say the combination"]],[1849,["of innocence and bhurvah state is auspiciousness."]],[1852,["Does your house give auspiciousness?"]],[1853,["Does your countenance give auspiciousness?"]],[1855,["Is your talk auspicious?"]],[1857,["Is it a mantra when you talk?"]],[1866,["Have you purified yourself so much that everything","that you do, every movement that you have,"]],[1871,["is auspicious?"]],[1873,["Is it blissful to be in your house?"]],[1878,["To be in your company?"]],[1880,["To be with you?"]],[1881,["Is it blissful?"]],[1882,["Let us direct ourselves to ourselves and see","that: are we blissful?"]],[1887,["Are we emitting vibrations that are good?"]],[1895,["It’s a very tremendous task because you","have to do it!"]],[1899,["You have to do it!"]],[1900,["Nobody else is going to do it!"]],[1902,["If you want to save this world, you must know","it’s a tremendous task and one has to go"]],[1907,["into a tapah for that, to know that you have","to be pure people."]],[1914,["Otherwise there could be hypocrites."]],[1915,["There are many who are Sahaja Yogis and not","at all Sahaja Yogis."]],[1919,["Sahaja Yoga is not for hypocrites at all."]],[1922,["You cannot be a hypocrite."]],[1924,["You have to be what you preach, what you say,","what you understand and what we stand for."]],[1929,["It’s not like this, “Oh I am a Christian,","all right, I am a Christian, but it’s all"]],[1935,["right, I can have adulterous eyes, all right","because after all, you see it’s all allowed.\""]],[1940,["“Then what else?”"]],[1941,["“Oh, I can drink, smoke.\""]],[1943,["“What else?”"]],[1944,["“Oh, I can also kill some people, it doesn’t","matter you see."]],[1948,["It’s all right I’m Christian after all.\""]],[1953,["How are you a Christian?"]],[1956,["Then, “I am a Hindu, you see I am a perfect","Hindu, but doesn’t matter if I try to discriminate"]],[1965,["between Sikhs and Hindus, doesn’t matter.\""]],[1968,["How, why?"]],[1969,["There’s no discrimination allowed in Hinduism."]],[1972,["No discrimination of any kind."]],[1974,["Everybody has the same Atma."]],[1979,["How can you discriminate?"]],[1980,["How can you have dowry system in a Hindu society?"]],[1984,["How can you have any caste system in a Hindu","society?"]],[1988,["You cannot have, just cannot have."]],[1992,["It’s not the religion."]],[1994,["So they speak one thing, do another thing,","it’s all hypocrites and all fanatics."]],[1999,["And that’s how they become fanatics!"]],[2002,["Like you ask Bishop of Canterbury, he says","that, “Holy Ghost, I don’t know, I am"]],[2008,["agnostic about it!"]],[2010,["I am doing my job!”"]],[2012,["That’s all!"]],[2013,["This kind of frivolous attitude or we can","say a very hypocritical attitude is not for"]],[2019,["the Sahaja Yogis."]],[2020,["They have to be what they are preaching, what","they are standing for."]],[2023,["They cannot have that kind of a personality","that one can say, “Oh, I have seen this"]],[2029,["hypocritical fellow, calls himself Sahaja","Yogi!”"]],[2032,["We can’t!"]],[2033,["There has to be somebody who is genuine, who","is real, who is truthful."]],[2039,["We cannot live with that kind of a compromise."]],[2044,["We have to be what we are because we have","got the light of the Spirit."]],[2050,["So then you go ahead and you have to become","the higher personality of a guru through consumption."]],[2059,["Consume, how much I consume!"]],[2062,["Go on consuming all the time."]],[2064,["This time I came, I am consuming your Left","Vishuddhis, I am consuming your viruses."]],[2069,["I don’t know, in two days I must have consumed","oceans and oceans of troubles."]],[2075,["No, we don’t consume at all!"]],[2079,["Because if somebody says something to us we","must come back with a harsh word, somehow"]],[2084,["or other to kill that person that is finished","forever – that’s smartness."]],[2090,["We can consume all that."]],[2094,["That consumption is taught by Christ very","well."]],[2097,["Can we consume?"]],[2098,["No!"]],[2099,["We come out with big, big talks and big, big","things, you see, “We must do this, we must"]],[2106,["do that!”"]],[2107,["We are not here union leaders, are we?"]],[2112,["We don’t want to appear in the newspapers","or anything."]],[2114,["What we want [is] to consume, we are here","to consume things."]],[2119,["Newspapers are to advertise, expand it."]],[2124,["We are here to consume all that is bad."]],[2127,["Do you follow your responsibility please?"]],[2130,["Consume [all] that is wrong."]],[2134,["How do we consume?"]],[2135,["Through meditation, through prayers."]],[2137,["Now this is happening in this country."]],[2139,["What are we doing about it?"]],[2143,["So we have to consume it, not to get into","explosions, not to get into expressions, but"]],[2151,["to consume it."]],[2156,["Then you become swadhaa."]],[2159,["‘Swadhaa’ is that you become the dharma","of the Spirit – ‘swa’, ‘dha’."]],[2170,["You sustain that dharma within yourself."]],[2173,["Then you become that."]],[2174,["It’s not any kind of hypocrisy about it."]],[2177,["I mean, if I say, “Don’t drink.\""]],[2180,["You shouldn’t drink wine."]],[2181,["I don’t drink at all I mean, no question!"]],[2183,["I mean, you cannot make me drink even if you","want to."]],[2187,["If I say, “Don’t tell lies!” then you","don’t tell lies."]],[2190,["You don’t just do it because you have to","just say that way, or you say that, “Don’t"]],[2196,["kill!”"]],[2197,["I cannot kill anyone."]],[2202,["I cannot be tempted."]],[2205,["In the same way you all have to feel, “I","cannot do it, I cannot be tempted."]],[2209,["How can I be tempted?”"]],[2211,["Say, “I shouldn’t get into tempers."]],[2213,["I shouldn’t be angry for nothing at all.\""]],[2215,["For the slightest thing, people just jump","into a temper."]],[2219,["That means, “I should not be tempted to","do that.\""]],[2223,["That wisdom, that dignity, that balance, that","poise must come into a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2228,["Unless and until that comes into you who is","going to believe you that you have achieved"]],[2232,["anything of this transformation?"]],[2234,["You are still on adhogati, sometimes into","urdhvagati."]],[2236,["Then going into adhogati, again to urdhvagati."]],[2238,["You are jumping from one to another."]],[2244,["So now you move on to another higher level,","is from there to [where], what you call, the"]],[2256,["‘Mahalakshmi tattwa’ starts; where you","start jumping on to a much higher position"]],[2260,["where it is mana."]],[2263,["‘Mana’ is emotions."]],[2265,["Your emotions become compassion."]],[2266,["Now see the difference between emotions and","compassion: is very different."]],[2272,["When the tree hasn’t got flowers it takes,","when it gets the flower, it gives, it gives"]],[2281,["the fragrance."]],[2282,["In the same way, when you become the compassion,","you give."]],[2285,["You don’t expect how others treat you, how","others behave towards you, but you think [that]"]],[2293,["by giving you will win over the person."]],[2295,["You give."]],[2298,["And that is what you have got: to give compassion","through your vibrations."]],[2307,["But to have that you have to be swadhaa."]],[2311,["Unless and until you have that you cannot","give vibrations either."]],[2314,["So then all these smaller ideas, “It’s","my wife, my husband, my child, my house, my"]],[2321,["this, my brother, my sister.\""]],[2323,["In the beginning everybody comes up with the","whole family list."]],[2327,["They may not have seen their father for ten","years but they’ll come, “My father is"]],[2331,["sick, Mother cure him first."]],[2332,["I have not seen him for ten years.\""]],[2334,["Doesn’t matter!"]],[2335,["So every person becomes a liability on Mother","that all the relations, all the great grand"]],[2340,["parents and all the great grand children must","be cured by Sahaja Yoga."]],[2349,["But there is no compassion!"]],[2358,["And in compassion you do not see these relations."]],[2399,["So, when you become the compassion, before","this you are to be enlightened."]],[2416,["You are to be enlightened, you have no light,","you don’t know how to walk the path, you"]],[2420,["don’t know how to go round, you don’t","know how to know others, you don’t know"]],[2425,["where you are sitting."]],[2426,["If in a group, you put off the lights everybody","starts hitting each other or trampling over"]],[2432,["each other because they don’t know."]],[2435,["But now the lights are on."]],[2437,["So you know how you are related to each other."]],[2439,["You are under the light."]],[2442,["You can see each other."]],[2443,["You can feel each other."]],[2444,["You can understand each other."]],[2446,["That’s how the compassion works."]],[2450,["Compassion works automatically – you don’t","have to do much about it."]],[2454,["But know that you have to be a compassion."]],[2455,["But if you are still are a person wanting","others to love you then it won’t work out."]],[2465,["How much did you love them?"]],[2473,["Is your love for another person doubted?"]],[2477,["Do you doubt?"]],[2480,["Then you are not compassion."]],[2483,["In that love you may even scold the person,","you may even shout at the person."]],[2487,["But the love should be there for the benevolence."]],[2493,["So the compassion should be for the benevolence","of the person."]],[2497,["If you are not benevolent you have not been","compassionate."]],[2500,["Like spoiling somebody, spoiling your child,","spoiling your wife, spoiling your husband."]],[2504,["This is not compassion!"]],[2506,["Compassion is a pure ray of beautiful light","of God’s love which gives benevolence to"]],[2517,["another person, hita."]],[2521,["So that should happen to you when you talk","of compassion."]],[2526,["You go further with the janah – public."]],[2530,["Those people who cannot carry on with Sahaja","Yogis are absolutely useless people."]],[2535,["These are the cream, these are the best people","in the whole world."]],[2541,["Of course some are like this, doesn’t matter."]],[2544,["But they are the topmost people, they are","the people wedded to such high ideals."]],[2548,["Where do you get anybody with idealism?"]],[2551,["You go to the UN, you go anywhere you find","people, they have no idealism of any kind."]],[2557,["It’s only for the job, only for the money,","or this or that, [that] they are working there."]],[2563,["You are the people who have idealism."]],[2565,["You are the people who are striving for something","higher."]],[2569,["You are the people who are going to save the","whole world."]],[2572,["And those who cannot carry on with Sahaja","Yogis and find faults with Sahaja Yogis are"]],[2577,["really no good for us."]],[2579,["They should get out of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2584,["What is your public?"]],[2585,["First and foremost is Sahaja Yogis."]],[2588,["The rest of them are outsiders so far."]],[2593,["But your attitude should be that you have","to pull them out."]],[2597,["You have to emancipate."]],[2598,["You have to be kind to them."]],[2599,["You have to be compassionate."]],[2601,["And you have to bring them to Sahaja Yoga."]],[2603,["You have to be extremely nice to them."]],[2606,["But more than that you have to be very, very,","extremely nice to Sahaja Yogis."]],[2614,["I can’t understand Sahaja Yogis being nice","to others and not to their own clan or you"]],[2619,["can call whatever you may call it – to their","own brothers and sisters."]],[2631,["When I see Sahaja Yogis together loving each","other, being kind to each other and also giving"]],[2637,["some good news about each other I feel extremely","happy."]],[2641,["That’s one of the most joyous times for","me."]],[2647,["When I find that you are giving."]],[2689,["So then you come to the point where you are","in the public, you are in the public."]],[2700,["You have to circulate now."]],[2701,["You have to articulate in the public."]],[2703,["You have to move in the public."]],[2705,["You are not only for a secluded group of Sahaja","Yogis, you are not that."]],[2711,["But you have to articulate, you have to circulate."]],[2716,["Now for that, what should we do?"]],[2721,["You have to understand that we have to form","other groups, other things by which we can"]],[2733,["circulate."]],[2734,["Let’s see now in England we can form some","societies."]],[2736,["Let’s form some society which are not what","we call them as the Sahaja Yogas."]],[2745,["Because you are different from them."]],[2747,["So now let us form some societies."]],[2749,["We form certain societies, say let us form","a society where we talk about the decadence"]],[2756,["of this country; how the decadence has come","in, why it is there, why are we spoiling our"]],[2764,["young children, why are we behaving like this."]],[2767,["Let us see."]],[2768,["Let us start a society under this name."]],[2772,["Let us start a society which will fight all","social problems."]],[2779,["Like I said in India: let us start a society","which is against dowry system."]],[2784,["That’s how you will circulate with them."]],[2787,["And later on when they come up to a point","they will see your character and then you"]],[2791,["can talk to them about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2797,["Like these women have, what is that called?"]],[2799,["‘Women’s lib’ and all that."]],[2801,["I mean, it is nonsense, you know that very","well."]],[2805,["But they have formed the society, so they","are there, they are circulating."]],[2810,["We have to have sensible, wise people forming","a society."]],[2814,["So from Sahaja Yoga group we have to move","to society: where you need not talk about"]],[2820,["Sahaja Yoga, you need not tell them there","is emancipation."]],[2823,["But let us circulate through them and let","them know about dharma."]],[2830,["Forming no religion as such."]],[2831,["It’s inner religion as we have."]],[2834,["Just without any religion you can start it","off."]],[2837,["So that’s how you meet the public."]],[2838,["There are many such ways, which you can think,","by which you can meet the public."]],[2844,["And then you have to know you are the part","and parcel of your Mother."]],[2849,["There are three things asked from God: that","there is salokya, that, “Oh God, We should"]],[2859,["be able to see you,” salokya."]],[2862,["Samipya is, “Oh God, let us have your company.\""]],[2867,["And third one is, “Oh God let us have a","rapport with you.\""]],[2881,["Rapport with you."]],[2883,["These are the three things are asked from","God."]],[2886,["But the fourth thing that has happened to","you is tadatmya, means you have become part"]],[2891,["and parcel of my body."]],[2892,["As a result of that you have to keep your","body all right, you have to be pure people,"]],[2898,["you have to be sensible, otherwise I get into","trouble."]],[2903,["But it’s a very venturesome thing I have","done, doesn’t matter, I don’t mind."]],[2911,["But you people look after yourselves."]],[2914,["You be sensible people."]],[2915,["And when you have funny ideas in your head,","know that these funny ideas can trouble our"]],[2920,["Mother very much."]],[2923,["So out of love for me, you have to keep loving","yourself."]],[2929,["And you can love yourself only if you have","pure intelligence to know what is frivolous,"]],[2935,["what is nonsensical, whatever is asahaj."]],[2942,["So you move like one body, always support","each other."]],[2945,["If one person is troubled the rest of them","should help."]],[2948,["That’s how the collectivity is going to","work out."]],[2951,["Not to criticise each other, to sit down and","just to show off."]],[2961,["So then you rise even higher to this state","of Jesus Christ, Mahavira and Buddha."]],[2970,["Then what do you have to do?"]],[2973,["Is tapaha, is the penance."]],[2977,["You have to do the penance."]],[2979,["Like living in Brahmapuri was a penance, I","thought, but you all enjoyed it bit too much."]],[2985,["Or Ganapatipule, you thought it was too much."]],[2987,["Some people did do some penance by sitting","in the sun! (laughing) But penance means ‘sacrifice’."]],[3001,["Sacrifice."]],[3005,["Without feeling the sacrifice, do the work","as a sacrifice."]],[3009,["You are bound by work."]],[3013,["We have to work."]],[3014,["Human beings have to work."]],[3016,["But the work that is a sacrifice is the most","nourishing thing, is the most joy-giving thing."]],[3021,["And that’s what happened: in Brahmapuri","I must say it was very spartan, both for you"]],[3028,["and for your hosts it was quite a funny place","to live in."]],[3034,["And one snake crawled into somebody’s shoes","I am told, but still you all enjoyed it because"]],[3040,["you didn’t feel the sacrifice."]],[3042,["It was in a way [a] sacrifice for both the","parties I think: your hosts and the guests."]],[3049,["But you still enjoyed."]],[3051,["And that’s what it is."]],[3053,["Now you will enjoy your sacrifices."]],[3057,["Apart from all other virtues you will enjoy","your sacrifices."]],[3060,["That is one of the quality of the Spirit,","because you are so detached."]],[3065,["You will enjoy it!"]],[3073,["So that’s how you come to the state of tapah."]],[3075,["And the last is satya, is the truth."]],[3081,["That is what is in the brain as Shri Krishna","has described, are the roots where you have"]],[3086,["to go."]],[3087,["Of course, the doors are open to you."]],[3090,["You must know that you know the truth!"]],[3092,["You know the truth, nobody else."]],[3095,["Are you aware of this, that you are the only","few people under this roof who know the truth?"]],[3105,["The rest don’t know any truth whatsoever."]],[3108,["So you have to be compassionate to them because","they are blind, they can’t see."]],[3112,["As we are kind to the blind people we have","to be kind to the people who do not know the"]],[3116,["truth."]],[3117,["You know the truth!"]],[3118,["And the truth is that you are the Spirit."]],[3124,["And then you know, through all miracles, that","you are walking in the Kingdom of Heaven."]],[3130,["That you are blessed by God and that you are","looked after by Him."]],[3133,["So many miracles happen, so many of these,","that suggest that you are really looked after"]],[3139,["by God Almighty."]],[3141,["So many beautiful things have happened to","you."]],[3144,["Just think of them one by one from where to","where we have come."]],[3148,["From down below hell rising up one by one,","step by step, now we have come to the brain."]],[3154,["Thanks to our Kundalinis that we have come","up there, that the Mother has brought you"]],[3162,["there."]],[3163,["This Kundalini which is your Mother has brought","you there."]],[3167,["Respect Her and respect your Realisation."]],[3171,["Respect each other and know that you are higher","than billions and billions of people of this"]],[3176,["earth."]],[3177,["You are special people and as that you have","to behave in the most humble, respectable"]],[3185,["and a loving manner."]],[3187,["I say love is the highest."]],[3190,["Everyone who has developed a language of love","is working out God’s wish because God’s"]],[3200,["wish, His desire, His iccha, that Shakti,","is the power of love."]],[3210,["We work out everything with hatred: what’s","wrong with that person, what’s wrong with"]],[3214,["that house, what’s wrong with this association,","with that."]],[3218,["That is all hatred."]],[3219,["But let’s see what’s good with that, what’s","nice, what’s joyful."]],[3225,["When your eyes turn that way, when your attitudes","turn like that, then you must know that you"]],[3230,["are Sahaj Yogis."]],[3235,["For that Christ has given us a big weapon","called forgive, forgive, forgive."]],[3245,["And the truth has dawned upon you."]],[3246,["You know the truth."]],[3247,["Through your vibrations you know, through","your vibratory awareness you know."]],[3251,["But, there is a very big ‘but’ for which","I have to tell you again and again and I am"]],[3257,["telling you again today which is the most","important thing for a Sahaj Yogi – is to"]],[3260,["use your vibratory awareness."]],[3263,["They don’t!"]],[3264,["They just don’t use their vibratory awareness."]],[3267,["In judging others they never use their vibratory","awareness."]],[3270,["Then how do we say they are special people?"]],[3272,["Because you have the same eyes, you have nose."]],[3275,["What about your vibratory awareness?"]],[3278,["Did you see the vibrations when you did something?"]],[3281,["You did not!"]],[3283,["That’s why the mistakes."]],[3284,["Because these vibrations come as an indication","from something that is your Spirit, which"]],[3291,["is an absolute thing, which is in absolute","state – it is not relative."]],[3296,["It’s absolute."]],[3297,["So whatever information it gives you is absolute."]],[3301,["And you should take to that absolute understanding."]],[3303,["This is where we miss."]],[3308,["So today just before Shiva Puja, Shiva Puja","is the puja of the Spirit within you."]],[3314,["It’s the Spirit within you."]],[3319,["And for this puja specially you have to determine","that now we will use our vibratory awareness"]],[3326,["to judge something."]],[3327,["“I think…” is not there."]],[3330,["“I think…” is a wrong idea."]],[3337,["I know through vibratory awareness."]],[3340,["We have to develop a word for this, which","we say, “I feel…” it could be something"]],[3346,["nonsensical."]],[3348,["But you really, as they say in Marathi there’s","a word, ‘zanee’: is a feeling."]],[3359,["But it’s a new awareness."]],[3362,["Through this awareness, this Divine awareness,","through that, you have to judge everything,"]],[3366,["to know everything, and to do everything through","that."]],[3369,["This is what we have to use."]],[3375,["And when we start doing that then you will","know that God is working out everything for"]],[3383,["us."]],[3384,["It’s so simple."]],[3386,["Life becomes much simpler."]],[3387,["All your complications, all your angers, all","your troubles, all will vanish as soon as"]],[3393,["you start using this, because it is such an","universal thing and such a benevolent blessing."]],[3400,["It just makes you wonderful."]],[3405,["You become a wonderful personality: happy","joyous, straight-forward, open-hearted, fearless."]],[3416,["Absolutely enchanting."]],[3418,["May God bless you all."]],[3423,["You want to have any questions?"]],[3429,["This lecture has been rather complicated I","think, in a way, so it’s better to repeat"]],[3443,["it or them, sometimes, again."]],[3444,["Maybe at Shiv puja would be a good idea."]],[3451,["Any question please?"]],[3452,["New Lady: How can you forgive a person like","Hitler?"]],[3461,["Shri Mataji: Actually, you see, you don’t","do anything."]],[3463,["When you forgive or not forgive, you really","don’t do anything."]],[3466,["It’s a myth."]],[3467,["It’s just a myth."]],[3468,["“I don’t forgive.\""]],[3469,["Means what do you do?"]],[3470,["It’s a myth."]],[3471,["New Lady: It’s how you feel towards a person","who has committed so many crimes and the detention"]],[3485,["of Jews."]],[3487,["Shri Mataji: But what about Jewish now?"]],[3491,["If they had forgiven Hitler, God would have","looked after him!"]],[3495,["God is looking after him."]],[3496,["But when the Jews didn’t forgive him, they","have become more like Hitler, sometimes."]],[3500,["They behave like Hitler sometimes I feel."]],[3503,["The way they are treating PLO people is something","horrible."]],[3506,["You see, so if you do not forgive you become","like the person you are hating."]],[3512,["If you forgive you don’t become like that."]],[3514,["Just that person goes out of your mind completely."]],[3516,["I mean, they have imbibed certain qualities","now."]],[3519,["I can’t imagine Jews behaving like this!"]],[3522,["They are behaving in a very funny manner."]],[3525,["You can see it clearly!"]],[3526,["I mean, they had no place to go, they had","no land to live, they were given a land."]],[3534,["And now the way they are troubling PLOs, I","was amazed."]],[3538,["Because I met some of the students of this","PLO people who came to India, who have been"]],[3542,["given asylum."]],[3543,["And when I heard how Jews tortured them – just","like Hitler, just like Hitler."]],[3549,["I wish they had forgiven."]],[3552,["I mean, if they had not forgiven Hitler, what","did they do out of it?"]],[3557,["Nothing!"]],[3558,["Hitler is punished by God, not by you."]],[3559,["What can you punish him?"]],[3562,["You cannot punish him."]],[3565,["Alright?"]],[3568,["When we forgive, we don’t imbibe that cruelty","within ourselves."]],[3572,["That’s the biggest thing that happens."]],[3574,["Apart from that we do not suffer when we forgive."]],[3580,["I mean, if you go on thinking about it, what","people did say, imagine, think of the people"]],[3590,["when Mr."]],[3591,["Columbus reached America, who followed them","[and] what they did there!"]],[3595,["Horrible things."]],[3596,["I mean, worse than Hitler."]],[3598,["They wiped out each and every person from","there."]],[3603,["Then when they tried to consume other countries,","going to other countries and ruling them."]],[3608,["If you go to China you will be shocked, even","about English, what they have to say."]],[3612,["Even in India, if you go, you will find."]],[3614,["How can anybody forgive them if you think","what they have done?"]],[3619,["But that is finished now and gone, forever!"]],[3624,["You are not to think about it at all."]],[3627,["It’s finished."]],[3628,["Today, what is the situation, we have to see."]],[3631,["You will be amazed, if I tell you, that myself,","I was tortured by English very much."]],[3638,["So what?"]],[3639,["For me you are my children."]],[3641,["I don’t think of that at all because that’s","finished."]],[3643,["They were bhootish people, that’s all – finished."]],[3645,["Where are they?"]],[3646,["Where is Hitler today?"]],[3648,["Where are those people who died?"]],[3650,["Finished!"]],[3651,["Better to forgive so that God punishes them","well."]],[3656,["Now, today, is not the time of punishing anyone,","it’s the time of evolving, of helping people"]],[3662,["to rise above that."]],[3664,["So there is no more danger of getting any","Hitlers on this Earth."]],[3668,["We have to create such a beautiful garden!"]],[3670,["Why to think of the thorns?"]],[3673,["Forget about all that nonsense, you see!"]],[3676,["These are special blossom times: let us think","of the flowers and not of the past and the"]],[3683,["thorns that we had finished off."]],[3686,["We have to give something very beautiful to","our children."]],[3690,["Isn’t it?"]],[3691,["A heritage where people will say, “Oh, I","see."]],[3694,["There were people who forgave all such things","and created a beautiful world for us!”"]],[3702,["Isn’t it a nice thought?"]],[3708,["Better than not forgiving."]],[3712,["Like that we go on thinking about, “He did","this and he did that.\""]],[3718,["There’s no end to it!"]],[3719,["God looks after!"]],[3721,["He’ll punish."]],[3722,["He’s punished him so badly."]],[3723,["Now nobody wants to take Hitler’s name!"]],[3725,["I mean, if somebody sees Hitler’s photograph","somewhere he will go and have a bath in India."]],[3731,["He’ll just go to the river Ganges and have","a bath, “Oh God!"]],[3735,["How did I see Hitler’s face anywhere?”"]],[3741,["What more you want as a punishment for Hitler","that they can ’t even face his photograph?"]],[3748,["And some person who looks like Hitler, they’ll","say, “You just shave off your moustache"]],[3753,["at least!"]],[3755,["Don’t look like that."]],[3759,["It’s very inauspicious!”"]],[3761,["Yes, I know somebody who looked like Hitler","and they said, “You shave off your moustache"]],[3766,["and comb your hair from the other side, or","make it a parting in the centre."]],[3770,["We can’t see you like this early in the","morning!”"]],[3777,["Imagine!"]],[3778,["What an inauspicious face! (laughter) He’s","hated by anyone."]],[3784,["You go to any place."]],[3786,["Even in Germany they hate him."]],[3787,["So what’s the use of such a character being","so much dominant on our heads?"]],[3795,["Have nothing to do with it."]],[3797,["Because once you start thinking about him","you also develop certain habits that he had."]],[3802,["A little cruelty comes up when you become","angry and when you cannot forgive others,"]],[3807,["you also think it’s right that you can punish","others."]],[3810,["Here we are not fighting the sword with a","sword but with a shield."]],[3814,["We are fighting the sword with a shield."]],[3818,["We never fight sword with a sword, we fight","it with a shield."]],[3826,["That’s a wise attitude towards life, I think."]],[3834,["Otherwise you will create more Hitlers."]],[3836,["One Hitler is dead and now ten Hitlers have","come out – already have come out!"]],[3839,["They are all to be finished now, once [and]","for all."]],[3849,["You can help by creating a new pattern, a","new world of beauty."]],[3874,["Any other question please?"]],[3875,["That’s a nice question, I know it happens","to her."]],[3879,["But now you are feeling better inside aren’t","you?"]],[3884,["(laughing) Much more!"]],[3885,["That’s how we have to bring peace on this","Earth."]],[3888,["How are we going to bring peace if there’s","still lurking anger?"]],[3895,["Not forgiving means anger!"]],[3898,["That’s all."]],[3903,["Hmmm."]],[3905,["What else?"]],[3910,["Ask some questions at least!"]],[3914,["Must ask some questions."]],[3916,["Yes, what’s that doctor?"]],[3919,["Dr."]],[3920,["Brian Wells: Shri Mataji, sometimes in my","work I find myself getting very angry with"]],[3935,["the people I work with is this ever appropriate","or should one always try and love and forgive"]],[3943,["them and be gentle."]],[3944,["Shri Mataji: Yes, better try that! (laughter)","As far as possible!"]],[3945,["But sometimes anger can also help."]],[3946,["But I think, just now, for us, we are developing","now, it’s better to take to the more gentler"]],[3950,["ways and things like that and not to get angry","– for the time being."]],[3953,["But we’ll have to show anger sometimes."]],[3955,["Let God show the anger."]],[3958,["Let him take the credit."]],[3961,["You will be more effective if you are gentle,","I tell you."]],[3966,["By anger you cannot correct people, you cannot","make them more efficient; but by love."]],[3975,["Those days are gone where anger and hot-temper","used to impress people."]],[3979,["Nowadays these people don’t like such people."]],[3983,["Anger or some people are also very silly."]],[3988,["They think [that] by being silly they’ll","impress others: like clowns or something."]],[3992,["It’s not so."]],[3993,["Now we are different people in this world","and they just know that this is a silly person,"]],[4000,["that’s all."]],[4002,["They expect a leader or anybody who has to","give something to others has to be something"]],[4008,["of a higher and a better personality – it’s","expected."]],[4018,["Cheapish things or anything that is publicly","people may like you to do, it a leader does"]],[4029,["that they don’t like it, they don’t like","it."]],[4034,["A leader is supposed to be something above,","above the normal."]],[4041,["But the idea of leadership these days is alright:","everybody is doing the ‘shake’ so the"]],[4045,["leader is doing the shake."]],[4046,["Then everybody wears a tight jean [so] the","leader also wears the tight jean and he can’t"]],[4052,["sit on his chair!"]],[4054,["So that’s not the way."]],[4056,["That’s not the way you can be leaders."]],[4059,["A leader has to make a pattern of his own."]],[4063,["And he doesn’t have to solve the problems","of the people but give them the problem to"]],[4067,["be solved."]],[4068,["That’s how leadership works out."]],[4070,["So for anybody who wants to get anything done,","must learn that the pattern should be of such"]],[4075,["a level that others should not take advantage,","should not think that they can bring you to"]],[4085,["your level."]],[4086,["For example, I’ll tell you: in India there’s","a habit of eating tobacco, dried tobacco."]],[4091,["Now, those people who eat tobacco, say there’s","a high court judge – he’ll call his peon"]],[4097,["and ask him “Have you go the…”, they","call it ‘dubbi’ means a small little pouch,"]],[4106,["so, “Have you got the dubbi?”"]],[4111,["So, the whole dignity is finished!"]],[4114,["Whole dignity is finished!"]],[4117,["That, just an ordinary peon can say, “Do","you want your dubbi?”"]],[4122,["So then it’s done."]],[4124,["What about his great position and dress and","everything?"]],[4130,["He makes a big gown and wears [and] on the","head they wear a kind of a wig."]],[4138,["And all that is useless because you are asking","for a dubbi from a peon!"]],[4149,["So what impresses people is dignity, balance,","poise, humility and truthfulness – straightforward"]],[4158,["truthfulness – even in day to day work."]],[4163,["Of course efficiency comes like that."]],[4170,["Peacemaking."]],[4174,["You must make peace between two persons, ten","persons."]],[4177,["Try to make peace instead of supporting one","person or taking sides."]],[4182,["Best is to make peace."]],[4184,["But if somebody is doing absolutely wrong,","then you have to take another attitude."]],[4195,["Any other question?"]],[4196,["Yes?"]],[4198,["Yogini: (unclear)"]],[4200,["Shri Mataji: What’s she saying?"]],[4207,["Yogi: She’s asking you to tell us how we","settle down in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4218,["For the new people."]],[4219,["Shri Mataji: Settle down in Sahaja Yoga?"]],[4220,["You are already settled!"]],[4221,["Gavin Brown: Some of the new people have come","quite new to Sahaja Yoga, they haven’t met"]],[4233,["you before Mother."]],[4234,["Shri Mataji: You see, I was born so settled","down I don’t know! (laughter) First of all,"]],[4242,["in Sahaja Yoga, one has to realise that you","have got vibrations."]],[4249,["Now, put it on that."]],[4251,["I think that’s the best criteria."]],[4253,["“Am I getting my vibrations alright?"]],[4257,["Are they flowing alright?"]],[4258,["If not, what’s wrong with me?”"]],[4260,["Direct your attention to yourself to find","out."]],[4263,["“Is there anything wrong with me that I","cannot get my vibrations alright?"]],[4266,["Alright!"]],[4267,["There must be something wrong."]],[4269,["Now what is that wrong?”"]],[4270,["Try to correct it."]],[4272,["First of all they must direct their attention","to themselves then they will start settling"]],[4275,["down."]],[4276,["But all the time, supposing, I have seen many","people who come to Sahaja Yoga: out of them"]],[4280,["some say, “I saw one Sahaja Yogi who was","like this!”"]],[4284,["They see to others: how they are are, how","they are, how they are."]],[4288,["You should see to yourself because this is","for your benevolence, for your betterment."]],[4293,["So the first attitude should be, “What have","I gained?"]],[4297,["What have I to gain?"]],[4299,["How am I to get better?”"]],[4303,["Or else there could be some people who think","that, “I must get better."]],[4308,["My health should be alright."]],[4310,["I didn’t get kshema, benevolence, as was","promised by Sahaja Yogis!”"]],[4315,["No, something wrong with you: still the yoga","is not established."]],[4319,["First establish your yoga."]],[4320,["If you have not established your yoga how","can you get what you want?"]],[4326,["So, first of all it’s such a genuine effort."]],[4329,["One has to be absolutely genuinely asking","for that yoga."]],[4333,["And you cannot force people."]],[4335,["You cannot force it."]],[4337,["Whatever lecture you may give."]],[4338,["You may like my lectures or anything, they","might sound very good but it doesn’t matter."]],[4342,["It must go into your being."]],[4345,["It must work out in your being."]],[4347,["You have to become something."]],[4349,["You should certify yourself that, “Yes,","yes."]],[4351,["I am like that.\""]],[4353,["We may be very few – doesn’t matter."]],[4355,["It’s meant for the few."]],[4356,["It cannot be given to every funny type of","a person or a person who is just forced into"]],[4363,["Sahaja Yoga."]],[4364,["You cannot force it."]],[4365,["It’s not like winning over election, you","see, that you make somebody a communist and"]],[4371,["overnight he becomes a capitalist."]],[4373,["It’s not like that."]],[4375,["It’s the inner growth."]],[4377,["And only those who are deserving, who have","that value of their own existence – only"]],[4384,["such people can come."]],[4386,["So you cannot force on them at all!"]],[4389,["They have to see to it."]],[4390,["And what they have to see in other people","[is] that what are they doing that they are"]],[4394,["so much settled."]],[4395,["And there should be an understanding that","we have just now entered into the university,"]],[4400,["say for example: a new class we are in."]],[4404,["Now how are we to go higher and higher?"]],[4406,["Their attitude has to be that way."]],[4409,["You cannot force things into them."]],[4410,["It’s like I always say [that] I have cooked","for you, the food is ready."]],[4415,["If you are hungry you will eat it."]],[4417,["I cannot force the food into your mouth!"]],[4419,["You have to taste it yourself and enjoy."]],[4421,["But there’s a gap, gap between when they","get Realisation and when they feel joy because"]],[4427,["specially in the West they have no idea as","to what Realisation is, they have never known"]],[4432,["the Kundalini."]],[4433,["It’s a new language to them, everything","is new, so they have to be given little assistance"]],[4438,["and help to tell them that, “No, there is","joy!"]],[4442,["You have to go beyond."]],[4443,["You have to see [that] these things exist."]],[4445,["Whatever the saints have said is true."]],[4447,["Whatever the scriptures have described is","true and you can find out."]],[4451,["But you have to have patience with yourself.\""]],[4453,["But if they want to criticise and they want","to say, “Oh, how can that be?"]],[4457,["And how can that be?”"]],[4458,["Such people will take too much time!"]],[4461,["But there must be some genuine seekers."]],[4464,["And there are some slow movers also so accordingly","they move and you cannot force them."]],[4469,["At the most you can support them for a while","but then again they drop down."]],[4476,["You have seen that."]],[4477,["It’s happening every time in the West specially,","not in India."]],[4481,["Not in India."]],[4482,["Not that, also, in [Indian] villages – it","doesn’t happen."]],[4484,["Once you get six thousand you get six thousand","– finished!"]],[4487,["I have known least of them."]],[4488,["I don’t know who they are [but] they are","there."]],[4491,["You meet them somewhere and they’ll just","come and fall at my feet and say, “Mother"]],[4495,["I am a Sahaja Yogi.\""]],[4497,["I said, “I know that."]],[4500,["I know you are."]],[4501,["You are my children I know just from your","presence I know you are my children.\""]],[4506,["So they have to become that."]],[4509,["You cannot force."]],[4510,["That’s one thing we do not realise."]],[4512,["You see, now, in the churches they are compromising,","“Let’s have a disco dance!"]],[4522,["And in the disco dance when the people will","come then we will have some Christians there.\""]],[4530,["Imagine!"]],[4531,["People who are going to disco dance how can","they be Christians?"]],[4536,["And this kind of a compromise is there because","it’s a money-oriented stuff."]],[4541,["It is not God-oriented, it’s money-oriented."]],[4543,["So, “We must have more people so that we","have more money so we can have more clergies,"]],[4547,["we can give more pay.\""]],[4548,["It’s all on that level [that] it works."]],[4551,["But not in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4553,["In Sahaja Yoga everyone is a temple of God,","everyone is a church of God and everyone has"]],[4559,["to come up to that."]],[4560,["And those who do not have that respect of","oneself, we cannot force."]],[4565,["How can you say, “You must have respect","for yourself!”"]],[4567,["Can you say like that?"]],[4569,["I mean, it’s something not possible."]],[4572,["That’s what you all people should know."]],[4575,["Also we should reconcile to that."]],[4578,["I have done my level best."]],[4581,["Except for standing on my head I have done","everything that is possible but what I find"]],[4586,["is that it’s very difficult."]],[4588,["Too much of ego!"]],[4589,["Too much."]],[4590,["Too much of ego in the West – absolutely","– and they are so ignorant."]],[4593,["They have never heard the name of Kundalini,","can you imagine?"]],[4596,["What tremendous ignorance there is."]],[4599,["But those who are wise, those who have pure","intelligence, came to Sahaja Yoga, they learnt"]],[4604,["everything, they know so much."]],[4606,["And some of the Sahaja Yogis in the West know","more than Indians know, I know."]],[4613,["We can say that there are many good Indian","Sahaja Yogis but there are some excellent"]],[4617,["ones in the West."]],[4619,["Par excellence, I should say, some of them","are."]],[4625,["So that’s it."]],[4629,["So why worry?"]],[4630,["We have the quality, if not the quantity."]],[4637,["But this quality only is going to attract","these ego people."]],[4642,["That’s only going to attract them, nothing","else."]],[4644,["This quality of your personality, of your","temperament, of your behaviour, everything"]],[4649,["is going to attract them."]],[4650,["But supposing tomorrow you say, “Alright,","I’ll make a holey jeans,” and walk about"]],[4657,["with the holes in the jeans and then people","will say, “What a nice Sahaja Yogi he is!”"]],[4668,["It’s not the way!"]],[4672,["You must have your own personality, you must","have your own dignity."]],[4675,["You shouldn’t behave like them."]],[4677,["But you should not condemn them either."]],[4679,["Know that they are ignorant."]],[4680,["They have no idea."]],[4681,["They don’t have the knowledge of the roots","at all."]],[4684,["You have the knowledge, so you have to be","kind like a teacher is kind to his students."]],[4694,["I never expected that in the West I’ll be","able to talk to so many people myself."]],[4698,["I mean, in the beginning when I came here","they used to say, “This Victorian old woman!”"]],[4705,["And all kinds of things they branded me with."]],[4707,["So it’s alright."]],[4708,["I didn’t mind that time."]],[4709,["Now they are alright."]],[4710,["That’s how they are, what can you do?"]],[4714,["To begin with they brand you, they do this","and do that."]],[4718,["Hmm."]],[4719,["Any other question?"]],[4722,["But the society you can form and get to people","who believe in a proper life, a healthy life"]],[4729,["and healthy society."]],[4731,["You can start a society like that, saying","that, “We want to belong to the healthy"]],[4736,["society.\""]],[4737,["You can take your children to that kind of","a thing."]],[4738,["You can get other children: where there are","no drugs and things like that."]],[4742,["You can start on that level."]],[4744,["Maybe from there you might get some people."]],[4749,["Anything else?"]],[4756,["Gavin Brown: Shri Mataji, whenever you speak","the questions go away!"]],[4775,["Shri Mataji: You jump into thoughtless awareness,","I know that."]],[4777,["Gavin Brown: There’s one thing we’d like","to ask you is to accept your birthday present"]],[4787,["a little early."]],[4788,["Shri Mataji: A birthday present?"]],[4789,["I mean if you have so many birthdays I’ll","become older very fast! (laughter)"]],[4797,["Oh, Gavin."]],[4800,["So sweet!"]],[4802,["Gavin Brown: Something very little."]],[4809,["Shri Mataji: You always say so!"]],[4814,["Thank you very much."]],[4818,["Thank you."]],[4820,["(applause) You better open and show them,","I don’t know what it is like."]],[4832,["They’ll be very happy to see that."]],[4865,["Those who have got Left Vishuddhi, I would","suggest you sit down with your left hand towards"]],[4869,["me and one hand on the Mother Earth – will","solve the problem immediately."]],[4873,["Just have it."]],[4877,["Left Vishuddhi."]],[4879,["Call your mother here."]],[4881,["Let her have a candle."]],[4895,["Left hand towards me and right hand [on Mother","Earth]."]],[4902,["What’s it Gavin?"]],[4907,["It’s quite a big thing."]],[4916,["It’s so many pieces."]],[4924,["I hope not you have spent so much money."]],[4931,["You can say the mantra in your heart, “Mother","I am not guilty.\""]],[4944,["First [for] your mother, just give her this","candle."]],[4955,["What’s that?"]],[4956,["Oh Gavin!"]],[4957,["Beautiful isn’t it?"]],[4959,["And a dolphin there!"]],[4960,["Just imagine!"]],[4961,["Thank you very much it’s beautiful."]],[4964,["It’s beautiful."]],[4967,["It’s very, very beautiful."]],[4971,["Beautiful."]],[4973,["Thank you very much."]],[4977,["Haa!"]],[4979,["Gavin Brown: It’s French."]],[4983,["Shri Mataji: It’s French?"]],[4988,["Why not get something English from English?"]],[4991,["Alright."]],[4992,["It’s alright."]],[4994,["For me it’s alright."]],[4998,["Aha."]],[4999,["Working out!"]],[5008,["Better?"]],[5017,["Cancer patients should be treated with this,","those who have got cancer or anything left-sided,"]],[5022,["psychosomatic."]],[5024,["The other day, doctor – you will be amazed","– there was a lady who came, she had cancer"]],[5028,["of the glands and she had tied up her head","with a scarf, in Madras."]],[5034,["So while talking I told her, “You take a","candle and sit there with your left hand towards"]],[5038,["me and right hand outside.\""]],[5042,["And after ten minutes I said, “Alright,","remove your scarf.\""]],[5044,["The whole thing was cured."]],[5050,["It’s tremendous."]],[5053,["And they have now started that PhD thing in","India."]],[5062,["Better?"]],[5068,["Much better."]],[5080,["It’s working out."]],[5092,["Good."]],[5098,["(Shri Mataji talks to some children)"]],[5115,["Akshay, you didn’t give me a kiss!"]],[5125,["You must give me a kiss too!"]],[5138,["Alright give it to Olympia then!"]],[5145,["Feeling shy!"]],[5146,["So I think I’ll take your leave Gavin."]],[5149,["Is it alright?"]],[5151,["So tomorrow I don’t think you can come early","in the morning, it’s too early – to the"]],[5184,["airport."]],[5189,["And I’ll be leaving about seven o’clock","from the house, at seven thirty-five I’ll"]],[5214,["be there."]],[5215,["Are you alright now?"]],[5217,["Good?"]],[5218,["So where’s the baby?"]],[5219,["Where’s Wendy’s baby?"]],[5220,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: It’s in Southampton","Mother."]],[5221,["Shri Mataji: Oh I see."]],[5223,["So you want to have the name?"]],[5227,["When was she born?"]],[5232,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: She was born on the","thirteen of February."]],[5244,["Shri Mataji: So call her ‘Himakanya’."]],[5249,["Himakanya is the name of the Goddess born","when…’Hima’ means ‘the snow’."]],[5258,["That’s the time she was born, when it was","snowing."]],[5278,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: It’s a boy Mother."]],[5289,["Shri Mataji: No."]],[5292,["Then ‘Himanshu’."]],[5294,["‘Himanshu’ is alright."]],[5297,["It’s a boy."]],[5300,["I thought it’s a girl they said."]],[5303,["Rodrigo Sanchez-Castro: No, no."]],[5305,["It’s a boy Mother."]],[5308,["Shri Mataji: Alright, so ‘Himanshu’."]],[5310,["It’s good."]],[5312,["‘Himanshu’ is a good name."]],[5314,["‘Himanshu’ means ‘the one who is born","out of the..’ ‘anshu’ means ‘the essence’"]],[5324,["‘Hima’ means ‘the ice’."]],[5326,["He’s the essence of the ice."]],[5328,["‘Himanshu’."]],[5329,["Is the name of Shiva."]],[5331,["(Mother meets another young child)"]],[5338,["This is a new one?"]],[5347,["New Sahaja Yogini?"]],[5355,["Aaah."]],[5357,["That’s Leela."]],[5362,["You want some chana?"]],[5367,["Leela’s sister: She likes that."]],[5374,["Shri Mataji: Do"]],[5389,["you like that?"]],[5390,["Alright, I’ll give her some chana."]],[5395,["Now only two can fit in here and let’s fit","the others there."]],[5406,["Alright."]],[5407,["So you carry some more."]],[5412,["She has big hands now!"]],[5414,["Come along, have some more."]],[5416,["You have big, big hands now."]],[5418,["You’ve become a big girl I must say!"]]]);
